---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import LessonGrid from '../components/LessonGrid.astro';
import BlochSphere from '../components/BlochSphere.astro';
import slides from '../data/slides.json';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { getPosts } from '../lib/posts.js';

const lessons = getPosts('lesson');
const latest = getPosts().filter((p) => p.category !== 'lesson').slice(0, 3);
const slideTotal = lessons.reduce((n, p) => n + (slides[p.slides]?.length ?? 0), 0);
const lessonCount = lessons.filter((p) => p.lesson).length;
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>India's quantum workforce can start in Kota.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Kota already trains lakhs of students in physics and maths. We teach quantum computing from absolute zero, for free, and make the case for bringing quantum jobs to the city.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/posts/roadmap-what-to-learn-first/">Start with the roadmap</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/lessons/">Browse all lessons</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note"><strong>{lessonCount} lessons and {slideTotal} slides so far</strong>, written for anyone with Class 12 maths.</p>
      </div>
      <BlochSphere />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Learn quantum computing in order.</h2>
        <p>Each lesson began as an Instagram carousel. Here you get every slide plus written notes. Begin with the roadmap, then work through the lessons one by one.</p>
      </div>
      <LessonGrid lessons={lessons} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block stone">
    <div class="wrap stone-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>Why build quantum in Kota?</h2>
        <p class="lead">Quantum computing needs people who are strong in physics and maths. Kota trains more of them than almost any city in India, and then watches them leave.</p>
        <p><a class="textlink" href="/why-kota/">Read the full case for Kota</a></p>
      </div>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><strong>The talent is already here</strong><span>Lakhs of students have mastered JEE-level physics and maths in Kota.</span></li>
        <li><strong>So are the teachers</strong><span>A whole city of people who explain hard science for a living.</span></li>
        <li><strong>It costs less to build</strong><span>Cheaper to live, hire and set up a lab than in Bengaluru or Delhi NCR.</span></li>
        <li><strong>The timing is right</strong><span>The ₹6,003 crore National Quantum Mission is funding hubs now. Rajasthan has no quantum plan yet.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Learning in public.</h2>
        <p>Kota Quantum Valley is started by {site.founderName}, {site.founderRole.charAt(0).toLowerCase() + site.founderRole.slice(1)}, who is learning quantum from zero and sharing every step.</p>
      </div>
      <PostList posts={latest} />
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href={site.instagram} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Follow {site.instagramHandle}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="/about/">About the initiative</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
